# Per-Dockerfile ignore (BuildKit): the root .dockerignore drops apps/web for the api image.
**/node_modules/
# `next build` loads .env files: a developer's local secrets must never reach an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/playwright-report*/
**/test-results/
.worktrees/
.git/
docs/
design-handoff/
apps/api/
